WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.534
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.767
According to a new report,
President Biden is ready

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.100
to help lobby moderate Democrats

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.434
to support reforming
the filibuster

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:15.100
and told Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.434
"Tell me when you need me
to start making phone calls."

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:19.601
Said Schumer,

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.934
"You haven't even started
making calls?!"

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.767
During a speech on Thursday
outlining his new plan

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.100
to fight the coronavirus,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.434
President Biden
scolded travelers

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.601
who refuse to wear masks
on airplanes.

00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:34.767
Great. Now do shoes.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.767
During a September 11th
memorial dinner on Saturday,

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:41.267
Rudy Giuliani imitated
Britain's Queen Elizabeth

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.434
by marrying his cousin.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:46.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:48.934
Supreme Court Justice
Amy Coney Barrett

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:50.267
appeared yesterday at an event

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:52.100
with Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.767
and said she was worried

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.434
that the public sees the court
as a partisan institution,

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:59.767
which is kind of like performing
at the VMAs with Taylor Swift

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:03.167
and worrying that people will
see you as a musician.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.834
The MTV Music Awards --
Video Music Awards were held

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:07.701
last night, and Madonna made
a surprise appearance

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:10.033
to open the show.
The audience was so shocked,

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:13.701
they all got out their phones
and looked her up on Wikipedia.

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.701
I know. They're young.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.567
I know.

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:20.234
The fast food chain Burger King
last week unveiled

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:22.400
its so-called Keep It Real Meal,

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.567
which partners with
several celebrities,

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.234
but uses their real names
instead of stage names.

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:28.901
Though I'm not sure how well

00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:32.234
the Robert Allen Zimmerman
burger will sell.

00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:34.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:36.234
An investigation concluded
last week

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:40.868
that a recent MTA subway outage
that shut down 83 trains

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:42.033
was caused by someone

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.200
accidentally flipping
a power switch.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.367
Said one man,

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.200
"So that's what it does!"

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.234
And finally,
Facebook has collaborated

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:53.067
with the eyewear brand Ray-Ban
to release new sunglasses

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:56.167
that can take pictures, make
phone calls, and play music.

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:57.501
On the downside,

00:01:57.501 --> 00:01:59.033
you're currently
sitting on them.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:00.501
♪♪

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:02.033
Secretary of State Tony Blinken

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.033
testified today before the
Senate Foreign Affairs Committee

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.133
about the U.S. withdrawal
from Afghanistan,

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:10.200
but not before trying
every other topic first.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.767
"Okay, before we get to that,

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.534
who wants to hear what's
in Area 51?"

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.667
After former President
George W. Bush appeared

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:20.267
to compare Capitol rioters
to foreign terrorists

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:23.501
in a speech commemorating
the September 11th attacks,

00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:25.901
former President Trump
said yesterday that Bush

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:27.601
"shouldn't be
lecturing anybody."

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:30.200
And I never thought
I'd say this sentence, but,

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.200
Bush, Trump,

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.467
you're both right.

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:36.334
The U.S. will host
a virtual summit

00:02:36.334 --> 00:02:40.133
with global leaders next week
called Global COVID-19 Summit:

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.400
Ending the Pandemic
and Building Back Better.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.133
In related news,
the Mets are hosting a seminar

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.767
at the Hyatt Regency called

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:48.367
How to Win the World Series.

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:49.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:53.100
Russian President Vladimir Putin
is reportedly self-isolating

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.167
after several members
of his entourage

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:57.634
tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.968
And they must have
some new variant over there

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:01.868
because one of the symptoms is

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:03.534
falling off a balcony.

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:06.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:09.133
