legislation today

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.601
which would make Election Day
a public holiday

00:03:13.601 --> 00:03:15.734
and require same-day
voter registration,

00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:18.734
while Senate Republicans
introduced legislations

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:21.033
