00:03:25.601 --> 00:03:27.567
[ Laughter ]
That's right, Senate Democrats

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.167
introduced a new
voting rights bill

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:31.267
which would make Election Day
a public holiday.

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:33.267
But not for you, Kornacki!

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:34.901
24 straight hours on your feet.

00:03:34.901 --> 00:03:37.968
No bathroom breaks for Kornacki!

